{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5602dcb36cc3b19bf6c2453d0bf5a714923c467b17941aa2bdfc88b36138effc", "ja": "アタシ達の約束の地！", "zh": "我们约好的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "243d4576ff1c6f7b47ef6643f51b8fceebd1793a32b947f9d922a753dc9d460f", "ja": "エドガーとクリスは吸血衝動を抑えるバラを\n見つけ、バラ農園を経営しながら穏やかに\n暮らしている。そこに、アレクサンドラと\nノエルの姉妹が辿り着く。エレオノーラは\n天国で、愛する家族と再会したのだった。", "zh": "埃德加和克里斯找到了能够抑制吸血冲动的玫瑰，一边经营玫瑰农场，一边过着平静的生活。此时，亚历山德拉和诺埃尔姐妹来到了那里。埃莉奥诺拉则在天堂与深爱的家人重逢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "749571d357263c059a85eb3bac6bc0c798c257bce35244002e51a7dd72cccac2", "ja": "クリス～！", "zh": "克里斯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "c2cc4e74262f51df9cf2f99e48d3c8ef0988c8f505d84c7e6ed447dda04bc7f4", "ja": "あら、エドガー。\nおはようございます。", "zh": "哎呀，埃德加。\n早上好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "a01260586b13923d039a3b22e279c4e7b947251148075f016b219be5ba5a85d8", "ja": "見てください。今朝も、\nお庭のバラが素敵に咲きましたよ。", "zh": "您看。今早，\n庭院里的玫瑰又美美地开放了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "fb0d37a226a6490c2a8e4db3a0a8c4e0aa91e2f9217ce8b8c67e4c8d00f5c29f", "ja": "わぁ……本当だ！\nいい匂いだね……♪", "zh": "哇……真的耶！\n好香啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "d03ed108d3a01a460083b8bffc1165c9e3e15d11e9d8e5912abce24bc051c64b", "ja": "それにしても、不思議だね。このバラに\n囲まれていると、吸血衝動が抑えられるなんて……。", "zh": "话说回来，真不可思议呢。被这些玫瑰包围着，竟然就能抑制吸血冲动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "47be4bedc2d4e1ac99b69598c92f56bb7630effb1908462b5c5dbf2e64f8817a", "ja": "ええ。私たちの約束の場所は、\nこのバラにあったんですね……。", "zh": "是的。原来，我们约定的地方，就在这片玫瑰之中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "3054e387735c9982cacd4ab483f3214ba626d6cb37aff55ac10e0e15dabe49c6", "ja": "ここで、ふたりでバラ農園を経営しながら……\nいつまでも一緒に暮らそう、クリス！", "zh": "我们就在这里，一边经营玫瑰农场……一边永远生活在一起吧，克里斯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "b253ffdae4ec0d52a84c7aaae0a0136bc7f2bb64e632909024535538d0e72234", "ja": "そうですね、エドガー。ふふっ。", "zh": "是啊，埃德加。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "c64e24e0de9ecf7ddf60340befd6f9544d1a0cc29e16151b4b7fe6debda0af78", "ja": "どうやら、迷い込んでしまったようだ……。\nしかし、こんなところに村があったんだな。", "zh": "看来是迷路走到这里来了……\n不过，没想到这种地方居然还有村子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "a82209404b557454ea890b2f5fe65df3bbb5d6f9eec314d4751e69cfab3f2fc0", "ja": "綺麗……！\nいたるところに、バラが咲き誇っているのね。", "zh": "好漂亮……！\n到处都盛开着玫瑰呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "514950ee5fa1a0587b6ff2fd1120010481fa66a7ecfe08242d6670f38561f0b9", "ja": "ノエル、気分はどうだ？", "zh": "诺艾尔，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "fa36605429254fcad7334843f5b0ff12a24cf18283ed42de58cedb55cba47762", "ja": "とてもいいわ、お姉さま。このバラの香り、\nなんだか心が落ち着くの。不思議だわ……。", "zh": "非常好，姐姐。这玫瑰的香气让我的心情平静了下来。真是不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "1c63ed05748a9e5c5c7182b3daa6a2a083e9811e30394df23183927b8b78136a", "ja": "それなら良かった。……そうだ。持ち主に頼んで、\nここで働いて暮らすというのはどうだ？", "zh": "那就好。……对了，拜托这里的主人，让我们在这里工作生活，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "381ab4e56c4b037502af752f21293198860119ebcc4c40f685cefc211ae2df84", "ja": "まぁ、素敵！\nそうしましょう、お姉さま！", "zh": "哎呀，太棒了！\n就这么办吧，姐姐大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "3ade53b739ff98c085ca8008ea0a829497b828fa9e6958805c88e92c252ed00f", "ja": "なら、早速尋ねてみようか。\n……すまない！　庭の持ち主と話をしたいのだが……。", "zh": "那就马上去问问吧。\n……不好意思！我想和庭院的主人谈谈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f5baa4fedf546ed3bb57cdbe67d13fc4a498f5f222ac5b08febe82f9c2925b2", "ja": "……。私、眠ってしまっていたのかしら。\nとても悪い夢を見ていた気がするわ……。", "zh": "……我刚才睡着了吗？\n感觉好像做了个非常可怕的梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "ecf66dc7f70e359a66aa915907264e4caeb111f28e91b737814c3cdf40a7d231", "ja": "あら……？\nまぁ、あなた！　アンジェラ……！", "zh": "哎呀……？\n哎呀，是你！安洁拉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "9a663973ddcd8b617ee08be510f8e50361b8d2e8e44e818c79ddadf192d6de4c", "ja": "どうしてここに……？\nいえ、そんなはずが……。", "zh": "你怎么会在这里……？\n不，不可能……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "cccb07d9e7138f65a40f9dacd741530a95f4790c352c6193062d88c2bc4e88a2", "ja": "……ああ、そう。わかったわ。\nここはきっと、天国なのね……。", "zh": "……啊，是这样。我明白了。\n这里一定，是天国吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "9f70df2e3a1e54d80373f89e6d160555dc94e8b7553df69c06d6c354e3aaa18b", "ja": "どうして、大勢の人を殺めてきた私が\n天国に来られたのかはわからないけれど……。", "zh": "虽然不知道杀害过那么多人的我，为什么还能来到天堂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "4efd4f482d1c6b5729f46db94eebda98fd84846dc65631bbb8f8fef189758743", "ja": "もしかしたら神様は、私が思っているよりも\n寛容なのかもしれないわ……。", "zh": "或许神明，比我想象中更加宽容也说不定呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_03_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "2ce96cd8ba79eb7e7b24b508a12adcd165dfcdc3a5198ffafb513e812fe8a963", "ja": "だって私には、あなたとアンジェラの\nいる場所こそが、天国なんだから……。", "zh": "因为对我来说，有你和安洁拉在的地方才是天堂啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
